
ScaledObject/worker -n app-a, created 1m ago, gen:2
  Current: Resource is Ready
  Scales Deployment/worker
  Replicas: min 2, max 6
  Timing: poll every 15s
  Triggers:
    prometheus/worker-demand @ http://prometheus.monitoring:9090
      sum(max by (priority) (app_queue_depth_by_priority{namespace="app-a"})) + sum(app_active_jobs{namespace="app-a", pod=~"worker-.*"}) > 20
